@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = PUT_TOKEN_HERE

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Register customer
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Test Customer","email":"customer@example.com","password":"CustomerPass123!"}

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@nabta.local","password":"PUT_ADMIN_PASSWORD_HERE"}

### Public products
GET {{base}}/api/products?page=0&size=20

### Create category (admin)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Plants","description":"Indoor and outdoor plants","active":true}

### Create product (admin; set categoryId to the ID returned above)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Snake Plant","description":"Indoor plant","price":19.99,"categoryId":1,"stockQuantity":20,"active":true}

### Place order (customer token required; use a new idempotency UUID per intended order)
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 52f7d9c9-9a48-41e9-a76d-2f7e2c500000
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"productId":1,"quantity":1}],"deliveryAddress":"Test address","contactPhone":"+911234567890","notes":"","paymentMethod":"CASH_ON_DELIVERY"}
